    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Going back to the basics, it is the storage, computing, and network behind every fancy technology. Technology choices are abundant and ever-growing - from registers to big data storage, processors to cognitive computing, and AI, with networking being only next to breathing. The breadth and depth of technologies are enormous.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "At Jivrus, we are passionate about building innovative, brilliant, resilient, and trustworthy software solutions. We provide platforms and extensions that help businesses and citizen developers get things done in a simple, efficient way.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/eb76ec0e2b1ad0b2.jpg",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 846,
     "h": 548
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "Bringing light and life to solutions that ensure your business success. That's what Jivrus stands for.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "34.6667px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "bringing-light-and-life-to-solutions-that-ensure-your-business-success-that-s-what-jivrus-stands-for"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Choosing right is a talent. But, automating business for success is more than just choosing right technologies and products for business. It is about enabling solutions for business; Shining light and life to solutions that ensure your business success. That's what Jivrus stands for.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "We connect the tiny dots in your business in the most awesome way with technology and platforms that gets things done in your business. We are the last-mile connectivity of your business and cloud platforms.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
